{
  "id": "isle_nella_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A hut on a sandbank, with a ledger on the table and forty thousand birds outside making it impossible to think."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eggs are in season or they are not. This week they are not.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_nest",
          "text": "How much of the Bank do they nest?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "isle_terns_nest"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                10,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_salvors",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "isle_nella_nest_told",
            "onFailure": "isle_nella_nest_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_year",
          "text": "When did they stop?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "isle_terns_year"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_salvors",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "isle_nella_year_told",
            "onFailure": "isle_nella_year_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_count",
          "text": "The count. All four generations.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "takers_count"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:takers_count"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_salvors",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "isle_nella_count_gave",
            "onFailure": "isle_nella_count_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_nest_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“All of it but the cut.” She is unbothered discussing it and bothered by the fact. “A tern will nest on a wreck. On a gun. On a dead seal. I have seen a pair raise two on a capstan.” She looks across at the strip. “Not there.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "isle_terns_nest"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_nest_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_nest_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_salvors",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_nest_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_year_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“One season, in my grandmother's count.” She says it precisely, because it is a number and she keeps numbers. “Full column the year before. Nothing the year after. Nothing since.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "isle_terns_year"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_year_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_year_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_salvors",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_year_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_count_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She fetches it wrapped in oilcloth, which tells you what it is worth to her. “The year it stops is marked. My grandmother put a line under it and did not write why, and I have wanted to know why since I could read.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "takers_count",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:takers_count",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_count_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "isle_nella_count_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is the family's,” she says. “Ask me anything out of it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_salvors",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "isle_nella_count_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
